Z||000000||Cheever2||07-31-2001||06:39 PM||||Just FYI to anyone attempting to email me.<BR>Something happened to my Windows loader (c:\windows\system\vmm32.vxd).  Reinstalling Windows made no difference, and the C&gt; prompt would not take ANY commands. Best Buy is going to replace the HD.  I have NAV and my last manual update was about 2 weeks ago (it caught the SirCam or whatever), but it still could have been a virus.  Going to have a firewall when I get back on.  <P>My last backup was May 15th, so I lost everything since then.<P>Meanwhile, I can be email'd at work: <BR>chodges@litton.c-bass.com<P>Thanks.<P>||||reg||9
