Z||000007||JSocha||08-01-2001||05:29 PM||||BTW Cheeve, sorry as to not acknowledge your recent loss as my sympathy's do go out to you your family and I can not imagine what you may be going through at this time, but after the funeral, if you need someone to talk to during your morning period we'll be here for you.<P>I myself have lost several drives without taking the time to acknowledge them when they were around with just a simple backup from time to time.  One does not realize after its gone, what a loss it is to one. Its not easy for the loss of those beloved programs, irreplaceable pictures and other memories that they held.  It truely is a sad moment and I share in your loss.<P>Hang in there my friend...you'll get through this.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
