Z||000009||Cheever2||08-01-2001||07:29 PM||||JSocha: Thanks.  This isn't my first HD loss.  I got a Compaq in June '00 and it lasted 30 days.  Best Buy said they already discontinued that model (!) so pick out another puter.  I got a HP.  The power supply died in 5 months.  They had too much on backorder and said pick out another one.  I got a new bigger badder Compaq on Jan 5.  At least this one lasted 7 months.  I'll be doing routine backups when it comes back, that's fer shur.<P>I'm an old mainframer, from <I>before</I> PC's.  Programmers could do amazing things with 8k back then.<p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 08-01-2001).]||||reg||1
